A rebuilt henhouse.

7
00:00:15,768 --> 00:00:20,442
Cabbages going one way, grappa and firewood coming back.

8
00:00:20,442 --> 00:00:22,408
Lessons in killing ducks.

9
00:00:22,408 --> 00:00:23,632
A knitted suit.

10
